  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Reason for Refusal\r\n\r\nThe proposed two storey side and single storey rear extension, by inclusion of an obtrusive parapet wall on the on the northeastern sidewall of the proposed side extension, would result in a feature that is unsympathetic with the both original design of the subject house and those that surround it, which would be detrimental to the appearance of dwelling and the immediate street scene.  The development is therefore considered contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development) and H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations) of The London Borough of Hounslow UDP, Adopted December 2003 and is not compliant with the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines.  \r\n"
